[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0412:b004:l023","ordinal":108289,"en":"Asked, ‘Which is the child Almam?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0412:b004:l024","ordinal":108290,"en":"Which is the child who has brought"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0412:b004:l025","ordinal":108291,"en":"Turmoil upon the whole world?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0412:b004:l026","ordinal":108292,"en":"Which is the child who will overthrow"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0412:b004:l027","ordinal":108293,"en":"And slaughter all the khans?’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0412:b004:l028","ordinal":108294,"en":"As turmoil fell upon Beezhin"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0412:b004:l029","ordinal":108295,"en":"And they could not find the child,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0412:b004:l030","ordinal":108296,"en":"His mother Altynai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0412:b004:l031","ordinal":108297,"en":"Had an amulet hung about his neck,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0412:b004:l032","ordinal":108298,"en":"Held him close against her breast."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0412:b004:l033","ordinal":108299,"en":"‘They will torment my child,’ she said."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0412:b004:l034","ordinal":108300,"en":"Misleading them about her child,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0412:b004:l035","ordinal":108301,"en":"She had her father Sooronduk rear him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0412:b004:l036","ordinal":108302,"en":"Letting no one suspect,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0412:b004:l037","ordinal":108303,"en":"Letting not a single person know,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0412:b004:l038","ordinal":108304,"en":"As the son of Khan Azyz,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0412:b004:l039","ordinal":108305,"en":"She guarded, nurtured, and raised him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l001","ordinal":108306,"en":"They had Sarala saddled."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l002","ordinal":108307,"en":"When he reached seven years,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l003","ordinal":108308,"en":"They had him taught wondrous knowledge."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l004","ordinal":108309,"en":"He grew to manhood as a hero,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l005","ordinal":108310,"en":"Equal to the sons of heroes."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l006","ordinal":108311,"en":"When he reached twelve,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l007","ordinal":108312,"en":"Dust rose wherever he went."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l008","ordinal":108313,"en":"‘If Almambet lives,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l009","ordinal":108314,"en":"He will cause some marvel!’ they said,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l010","ordinal":108315,"en":"And Ez-kara nearly died of fright."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l011","ordinal":108316,"en":"When he reached twelve,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l012","ordinal":108317,"en":"He slipped quietly away and lost himself."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l013","ordinal":108318,"en":"In the hollow of Kyr-Kaiyng,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l014","ordinal":108319,"en":"Along Khan-Zhailak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l015","ordinal":108320,"en":"Contending for the mountains of Chai-Kent—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l016","ordinal":108321,"en":"From those who came, I heard news:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l017","ordinal":108322,"en":"In the desert of Mediyan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l018","ordinal":108323,"en":"Konurbai, son of Alooke,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l019","ordinal":108324,"en":"From atop Algara,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l020","ordinal":108325,"en":"Six times that Kalcha"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l021","ordinal":108326,"en":"He knocked down into the ground, I heard."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l022","ordinal":108327,"en":"Hero Almam alone, out of Beezhin,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l023","ordinal":108328,"en":"Until the soft kurai stems ripened,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l024","ordinal":108329,"en":"Until the autumn gossamer flew,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l025","ordinal":108330,"en":"Kept fighting, I heard."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l026","ordinal":108331,"en":"Escaping death,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l028","ordinal":108332,"en":"Fighting for the khanship,","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l029","ordinal":108333,"en":"Renouncing their idols,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l030","ordinal":108334,"en":"Smashing their people,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l031","ordinal":108335,"en":"Scattering everything he had amassed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l032","ordinal":108336,"en":"Desiring faith alone,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l033","ordinal":108337,"en":"Staining the golden throne with blood,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l034","ordinal":108338,"en":"Saying, ‘He will not do as I say,’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l035","ordinal":108339,"en":"He killed his father."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l036","ordinal":108340,"en":"Without looking about him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l037","ordinal":108341,"en":"Without sparing his own life,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l038","ordinal":108342,"en":"Almambet, son of Khan Azyz,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b003:l039","ordinal":108343,"en":"Went down into Altai, I heard."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l001","ordinal":108344,"en":"Killing the khan of Altai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l002","ordinal":108345,"en":"Growing fierce and hardened,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l003","ordinal":108346,"en":"Your dark, wolf-like Ala,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l004","ordinal":108347,"en":"Known as ‘Bloody Neck,’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l005","ordinal":108348,"en":"Journeyed day and night,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l006","ordinal":108349,"en":"Rode far without sparing his horse,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l007","ordinal":108350,"en":"And entered Khangai, I heard."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l008","ordinal":108351,"en":"Bloodied up to his forearms,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l009","ordinal":108352,"en":"He killed the khan of Khangai."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l010","ordinal":108353,"en":"Finding no place to turn,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l011","ordinal":108354,"en":"Finding no people like the Muslims,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l012","ordinal":108355,"en":"Finding no lion to whom he could unburden his grief,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l013","ordinal":108356,"en":"He came to Sary-Arka, I heard."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l014","ordinal":108357,"en":"For Kokcho in Sary-Arka,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l015","ordinal":108358,"en":"He brought prosperity to his felt-covered home."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l016","ordinal":108359,"en":"When he met Kokcho,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l017","ordinal":108360,"en":"He made him khan over lands on every side,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l018","ordinal":108361,"en":"Accomplishing what he desired,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l019","ordinal":108362,"en":"Filling all his chests"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l020","ordinal":108363,"en":"With yellow gold and riches,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l021","ordinal":108364,"en":"Hiding his livestock pens in dust,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l022","ordinal":108365,"en":"Raising his khanship above the people,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l023","ordinal":108366,"en":"Hiding his pastures in dust,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l024","ordinal":108367,"en":"Raising Kokcho, son of Aidarkan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l025","ordinal":108368,"en":"To greatness beyond other men."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l026","ordinal":108369,"en":"When he came to hero Kokcho,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l027","ordinal":108370,"en":"In the foothills of Sary-Arka"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l028","ordinal":108371,"en":"Almam settled for the summer, I heard."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l029","ordinal":108372,"en":"Of the Black Kalmyks and the Manchus,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l030","ordinal":108373,"en":"He broke their guard and brought back"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l031","ordinal":108374,"en":"Some forty men bound, I heard."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l032","ordinal":108375,"en":"He settled in Sary-Arka."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l033","ordinal":108376,"en":"Since Almambet came to Kokcho,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l034","ordinal":108377,"en":"Some six years had passed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l035","ordinal":108378,"en":"Without sitting down to talk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l036","ordinal":108379,"en":"Without asking how he was,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l037","ordinal":108380,"en":"At the season near autumn,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l038","ordinal":108381,"en":"He would slaughter sixty beasts."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0413:b004:l039","ordinal":108382,"en":"Your hero Almam, idle and restless,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l001","ordinal":108383,"en":"Finding no enemy to fight,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l002","ordinal":108384,"en":"Finding no mountain to charge,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l003","ordinal":108385,"en":"He would vanish six months, seven months,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l004","ordinal":108386,"en":"Going off on a long hunting expedition."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l005","ordinal":108387,"en":"When he returned from the hunt,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l006","ordinal":108388,"en":"When my Almam turned back toward Sary-Arka,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l007","ordinal":108389,"en":"Foolish Kokcho gathered troops,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l008","ordinal":108390,"en":"Gathered an immeasurable multitude,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l009","ordinal":108391,"en":"Having heard gossip from the people,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l010","ordinal":108392,"en":"That Akerkech, his friend's wife,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l011","ordinal":108393,"en":"Was his lover, so he heard;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l012","ordinal":108394,"en":"Of skilled wielders of the spear"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l013","ordinal":108395,"en":"He gathered all he could."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l014","ordinal":108396,"en":"Intending to exchange fire,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l015","ordinal":108397,"en":"While that Kokcho waited,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l016","ordinal":108398,"en":"Akerkech, Kokcho's wife,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l017","ordinal":108399,"en":"Wiser than other people,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l018","ordinal":108400,"en":"Came out to meet him, sobbing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l019","ordinal":108401,"en":"Akerkech, his friend's wife,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l020","ordinal":108402,"en":"Weeping, crying out:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l021","ordinal":108403,"en":"“My banner on a red spear,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l022","ordinal":108404,"en":"Dear son, my gift come from China!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l023","ordinal":108405,"en":"There is no shame in weighty words;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l024","ordinal":108406,"en":"Turn your horse's head awhile,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l025","ordinal":108407,"en":"Dear son, stand a little way ahead!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l026","ordinal":108408,"en":"‘Along the ruddy shelduck's waters,’ they say,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l027","ordinal":108409,"en":"‘Akerkech, his friend's wife,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l028","ordinal":108410,"en":"Is this man's lover,’ they say."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l029","ordinal":108411,"en":"‘White wheat flour makes dough,’ they say,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l030","ordinal":108412,"en":"‘The two of us are intimates,’ they say."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l031","ordinal":108413,"en":"The pit he dug became deep;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l032","ordinal":108414,"en":"The Kazakhs gathered a mighty army."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l034","ordinal":108415,"en":"The day clouded over, and spring came;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l035","ordinal":108416,"en":"That bastard Kokcho, Aidarkan's son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l036","ordinal":108417,"en":"Became an enemy to his own good fortune."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b003:l037","ordinal":108418,"en":"If it is plentiful, it tastes like honey,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l001","ordinal":108419,"en":"Toward that damned Kokcho, Aidarkan's son.","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l003","ordinal":108420,"en":"These Kazakhs standing here"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l004","ordinal":108421,"en":"Are no men to stop your laughter,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l005","ordinal":108422,"en":"No lions to break your strength;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l006","ordinal":108423,"en":"Laughing and playing among the Kazakhs,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l007","ordinal":108424,"en":"They are no people to settle beside."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l008","ordinal":108425,"en":"You have lost heart in Kokcho;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l009","ordinal":108426,"en":"Move away to Talas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l010","ordinal":108427,"en":"Go and make your camp beside"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l011","ordinal":108428,"en":"Manas, Zhakyp's only son.”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l012","ordinal":108429,"en":"Akerkech, his friend's wife,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l013","ordinal":108430,"en":"Had spoken these words;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l014","ordinal":108431,"en":"Akerkech wept and spoke,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l015","ordinal":108432,"en":"Brooding on the filthy slander."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l016","ordinal":108433,"en":"Over what had happened last month,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l017","ordinal":108434,"en":"Offended bitterly, to death,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l018","ordinal":108435,"en":"Because of Akerkech,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l019","ordinal":108436,"en":"Because of the troublemaker,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l020","ordinal":108437,"en":"Over this Erkech's affair,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l021","ordinal":108438,"en":"Kokcho, Aidarkan's son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l022","ordinal":108439,"en":"Deep among the reeds,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l023","ordinal":108440,"en":"He penned him in and left, I heard."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l024","ordinal":108441,"en":"Making the Kazakhs resound with blows,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l025","ordinal":108442,"en":"He beat them and left, I heard."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l026","ordinal":108443,"en":"It was that Almam himself;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l027","ordinal":108444,"en":"It was time for him to enter Mecca"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l028","ordinal":108445,"en":"And return from his pilgrimage."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l029","ordinal":108446,"en":"Your eagle and sword in the dream,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l030","ordinal":108447,"en":"Were they Almambet himself?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l031","ordinal":108448,"en":"Your Alake, the one God"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l032","ordinal":108449,"en":"Is about to grant you.”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l033","ordinal":108450,"en":"I, your unfortunate mother,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l034","ordinal":108451,"en":"Having heard the truth of this news,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l035","ordinal":108452,"en":"Having heard King Bakai's words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l036","ordinal":108453,"en":"With sixty wives and forty girls"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l037","ordinal":108454,"en":"As attendants by my side,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l038","ordinal":108455,"en":"Set out from Talas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0414:b004:l039","ordinal":108456,"en":"I traveled across the face of the earth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l001","ordinal":108457,"en":"A saint well versed in mortal ways,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l002","ordinal":108458,"en":"That uncle Bakai of mine,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l003","ordinal":108459,"en":"I took as my companion."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l004","ordinal":108460,"en":"Almambet, son of King Azyz,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l005","ordinal":108461,"en":"Was due to turn back, I thought,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l006","ordinal":108462,"en":"And I went to meet him in Bukhara."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l007","ordinal":108463,"en":"Having welcomed him in Bukhara,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l008","ordinal":108464,"en":"I gathered khojas and mullahs,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l009","ordinal":108465,"en":"And honored him as my guest for nine days."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l010","ordinal":108466,"en":"Aruuke, Agynai's daughter,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l011","ordinal":108467,"en":"Whose father and mine were brothers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l012","ordinal":108468,"en":"My younger cousin, I married to him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l013","ordinal":108469,"en":"A star moved in the sky;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l014","ordinal":108470,"en":"Your father and your Alake,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l015","ordinal":108471,"en":"Friends even in the other world,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l016","ordinal":108472,"en":"He came and settled in Talas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l017","ordinal":108473,"en":"As soon as he arrived, he befriended"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l018","ordinal":108474,"en":"Manas, now gone to Judgment."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l019","ordinal":108475,"en":"Your father and your Alake"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l020","ordinal":108476,"en":"Chewed white wheat flour together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l021","ordinal":108477,"en":"To enter battle side by side,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l022","ordinal":108478,"en":"Taking hold of the Holy Quran."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l023","ordinal":108479,"en":"When Almambet settled in Talas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l024","ordinal":108480,"en":"When he became your father's companion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l025","ordinal":108481,"en":"It was then your royal father said:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l026","ordinal":108482,"en":"“Ah, Kanykei, my senior wife,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l028","ordinal":108483,"en":"This is the time they sway;","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l029","ordinal":108484,"en":"Joining Argyn and Kyrgyz together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l030","ordinal":108485,"en":"This is the time we rejoice."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l031","ordinal":108486,"en":"Argyn and Kyrgyz mingled,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l032","ordinal":108487,"en":"Today they dwell together;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l033","ordinal":108488,"en":"Kumis by day, girls by night,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l034","ordinal":108489,"en":"That is the life today."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l035","ordinal":108490,"en":"To this head blessed by Kydyr,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l036","ordinal":108491,"en":"Have all the mighty now come?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l037","ordinal":108492,"en":"With my precious Almam found,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l038","ordinal":108493,"en":"Has the Creator truly granted him?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b003:l039","ordinal":108494,"en":"My sworn friend, my confidant,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l001","ordinal":108495,"en":"For that hungry lion, that noble falcon,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l002","ordinal":108496,"en":"If we do not allot him a coat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l003","ordinal":108497,"en":"If we show him no respect,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l004","ordinal":108498,"en":"Will God not strike us down?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l005","ordinal":108499,"en":"Wife, will this warrior's spirit not be broken?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l007","ordinal":108500,"en":"Will God not strike us down from the outset?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l008","ordinal":108501,"en":"On Almam's arm,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l009","ordinal":108502,"en":"If we do not hang black steel,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l010","ordinal":108503,"en":"Not growing thin after six months' riding,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l011","ordinal":108504,"en":"For that noble soul himself,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l012","ordinal":108505,"en":"If we do not allot a horse,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l013","ordinal":108506,"en":"Let us die unworthy of the human name;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l014","ordinal":108507,"en":"Rather than lumbering about,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l015","ordinal":108508,"en":"Let the hour of our birth be cursed!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l016","ordinal":108509,"en":"Making his weapons secure,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l017","ordinal":108510,"en":"Then the lion"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l018","ordinal":108511,"en":"Let us send forth and see his strength."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l019","ordinal":108512,"en":"I have Chinese on my flank,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l020","ordinal":108513,"en":"I have Franks before me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l021","ordinal":108514,"en":"Many enemies stand ready to oppose me."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l022","ordinal":108515,"en":"Go, my wife, go,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l023","ordinal":108516,"en":"Your father's Aktulpar,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l024","ordinal":108517,"en":"Find a way to bring him here;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l025","ordinal":108518,"en":"Use your privilege as his darling."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l026","ordinal":108519,"en":"When you go humbly to ask for him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l027","ordinal":108520,"en":"He will consent to your words;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l028","ordinal":108521,"en":"If he is truly a king,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l029","ordinal":108522,"en":"He will give you Aktulpar,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l030","ordinal":108523,"en":"He will agree to what you say."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l031","ordinal":108524,"en":"With golden forelock and tasselled belt,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l032","ordinal":108525,"en":"To King Azyz's only son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l033","ordinal":108526,"en":"He will surely allot him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l034","ordinal":108527,"en":"The youngest of twelve daughters,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l035","ordinal":108528,"en":"If you insist, he will heed your words;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l036","ordinal":108529,"en":"If he thinks you his true child,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l037","ordinal":108530,"en":"He will give you Aktulpar.”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l038","ordinal":108531,"en":"Your father spoke, and I listened;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0415:b004:l039","ordinal":108532,"en":"I agreed to his words."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0416:b003:l001","ordinal":108533,"en":"Entering the palace,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0416:b003:l002","ordinal":108534,"en":"Lined inside with silk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0416:b003:l003","ordinal":108535,"en":"I, your mother Kanykei,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0416:b003:l004","ordinal":108536,"en":"Had worked its patterns with my teeth for seven unceasing years;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0416:b003:l005","ordinal":108537,"en":"Between Orenburg and Margilan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0416:b003:l006","ordinal":108538,"en":"I had the intervening country searched,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0416:b003:l007","ordinal":108539,"en":"The freight-carrier's cotton"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0416:b003:l008","ordinal":108540,"en":"I had taken by force."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0416:b003:l009","ordinal":108541,"en":"The filings of hard iron,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0416:b003:l010","ordinal":108542,"en":"Its filings carefully fitted,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0416:b003:l011","ordinal":108543,"en":"I had them placed within;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0416:b003:l012","ordinal":108544,"en":"It filled anyone who saw it with delight."}]
